      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but the thing is, these aren't just regular productivity slips. it feels much more targeted than that. like i'm being watched to see if i can handle high-stakes oversight. if i'm sloppy, it's not just that my boss gets annoyed, it's that i'm failing a specific assessment. i need to be able to account for every single minute and every single data point so there's absolutely nothing for them to use against me. can we focus on a more rigorous, high-fidelity tracking method? something that ensures there's zero margin for error in my daily logs? i can't afford to have any \"hiccups\" if i want to stay in their good graces.",
